#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: zinn-translate.php
#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:706
msgid "Zinn® Translate"
msgstr "Zinn® Translate"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: zinn-translate.php
msgid "https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-translate"
msgstr "https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-translate"

#. Description of the plugin
#: zinn-translate.php
msgid "Publishes this site in every language you choose, on its own web addresses, with translated slugs, metadata, menus, WooCommerce products, hreflang, per-language sitemaps and llms.txt. Translate with your Zinn Digital® plan or with your own provider key."
msgstr "Objavljuje ovu web-lokaciju na svakom jeziku koji odaberete, na vlastitim web-adresama, s prevedenim adresama, metapodacima, izbornicima, WooCommerce proizvodima, hreflang oznakama, kartama web-lokacije za svaki jezik i llms.txt datotekom. Prevodite uz svoj Zinn Digital® paket ili s ključem vlastitog pružatelja usluga."

#. Author of the plugin
#: zinn-translate.php
msgid "Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd"
msgstr "Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: zinn-translate.php
msgid "https://zinndigital.com"
msgstr "https://zinndigital.com"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:62
#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:632
#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:633
msgid "Translate"
msgstr "Prevedi"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:76
#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:767
msgid "Manual overrides"
msgstr "Ručne prilagodbe"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:81
#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:769
msgid "Sitemaps and URLs"
msgstr "Sikempe i URL-ovi"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:111
msgid "General"
msgstr "Općenito"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:116
msgid "Who pays for the translation"
msgstr "Tko plaća prijevod"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:117
msgid "Either your Zinn Digital® plan, or an API key of your own. There is no free tier — somebody pays a provider for every word."
msgstr "Ili vaš Zinn Digital® plan ili vaš vlastiti API ključ. Ne postoji besplatna razina — netko plaća pružatelju usluge za svaku riječ."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:120
#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:721
msgid "My Zinn Digital® plan"
msgstr "Moj Zinn Digital® paket"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:121
#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:722
msgid "My own provider key"
msgstr "Moj vlastiti ključ davatelja usluge"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:128
#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:726
msgid "Site ID"
msgstr "ID web-mjesta"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:129
msgid "From your Zinn Digital® dashboard, on this site's Translation tab."
msgstr "Iz nadzorne ploče Zinn Digital®, na kartici Prijevod ove web-lokacije."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:136
#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:730
msgid "Site token"
msgstr "Token web-mjesta"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:144
#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:734
msgid "Provider"
msgstr "Pružatelj usluga"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:154
#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:744
msgid "API key"
msgstr "API ključ"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:155
msgid "Your key, billed to you by the provider. It is stored on this site and sent only to them."
msgstr "Vaš ključ koji vam naplaćuje pružatelj usluge. Pohranjen je na ovoj stranici i šalje se samo njima."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:163
msgid "Model"
msgstr "Model"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:164
msgid "Leave empty for the cheapest model that does the job well."
msgstr "Ostavite prazno za najjeftiniji model koji dobro obavlja posao."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:171
msgid "This site is written in"
msgstr "Ova je stranica napisana na"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:172
msgid "Leave empty to use the site language from WordPress settings."
msgstr "Ostavite prazno za korištenje jezika stranice iz postavki za WordPress."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:180
#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:748
msgid "Languages to publish"
msgstr "Jezici za objavu"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:181
msgid "Each one gets its own web addresses and its own sitemap. Publish only the languages you want indexed."
msgstr "Svaka dobiva vlastite web adrese i vlastitu kartu web-lokacije. Objavite samo one jezike koje želite indeksirati."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:188
msgid "Translate automatically when I publish or update"
msgstr "Prevedi automatski kada objavim ili ažuriram"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:189
msgid "Editing a page marks its translations out of date and they are remade in the background. Editing without changing any words costs nothing."
msgstr "Uređivanje stranice označava njezine prijevode zastarjelima i oni se ponovno izrađuju u pozadini. Uređivanje bez mijenjanja riječi ne košta ništa."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:196
msgid "What gets translated"
msgstr "Što se prevodi"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:201
msgid "Post types"
msgstr "Vrste postova"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:209
msgid "Translate the web addresses too"
msgstr "Prevedite i web adrese"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:210
msgid "French visitors get /fr/a-propos/ rather than /fr/about/. The untranslated address keeps working and redirects, so nothing that was indexed breaks."
msgstr "Francuski posjetitelji dobivaju /fr/a-propos/ umjesto /fr/about/. Netraducirana adresa nastavlja raditi i preusmjerava, tako da se ništa što je bilo indeksirano ne ruši."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:217
msgid "Translate SEO titles, descriptions and image alt text"
msgstr "Prevedite SEO naslove, opise i alt tekst slika"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:224
msgid "Translate categories and tags"
msgstr "Prevedi kategorije i oznake"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:231
msgid "Translate navigation menus"
msgstr "Prevedi navigacijske izbornike"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:238
msgid "Translate WooCommerce products and attributes"
msgstr "Prevedite WooCommerce proizvode i atribute"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:239
msgid "Short descriptions, purchase notes, attribute labels and variation descriptions. Prices, SKUs and stored option values are never touched."
msgstr "Kratki opisi, bilješke uz kupnju, oznake atributa i opisi varijanti. Cijene, SKU-ovi i spremljene vrijednosti opcija nikada se ne mijenjaju."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:246
msgid "SEO"
msgstr "SEO"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:251
msgid "Add hreflang tags"
msgstr "Dodaj hreflang oznake"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:252
msgid "Tells search engines these pages are the same page in different languages. Leave this on unless another plugin is already doing it."
msgstr "Govori tražilicama da su ove stranice ista stranica na različitim jezicima. Ostavite ovo uključeno osim ako to već ne radi neki drugi dodatak."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:259
msgid "Publish a sitemap for each language"
msgstr "Objavite kartu web-lokacije za svaki jezik"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:266
msgid "Publish llms.txt for each language"
msgstr "Objavi llms.txt za svaki jezik"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:267
msgid "A plain-text map of the site that AI answer engines read. They often cannot run JavaScript and may never fetch a sitemap."
msgstr "Karta web-mjesta u običnom tekstu koju čitaju AI tražilice. One često ne mogu pokretati JavaScript i možda nikada neće dohvatiti sitemap."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:274
#: includes/class-zinn-translate-switcher.php:135
msgid "Language switcher"
msgstr "Jezični prebacivač"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:279
#: includes/class-zinn-translate-switcher-widget.php:83
msgid "Style"
msgstr "Stil"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:282
msgid "Colours, spacing and corners are on the Styling tab. Place it with the block, the [zinn_language_switcher] shortcode, or a menu."
msgstr "Boje, razmaci i rubovi nalaze se na kartici Stiliziranje. Postavite ga s blokom, kratkim kodom [zinn_language_switcher] ili izbornikom."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:289
msgid "Show only these languages"
msgstr "Prikaži samo ove jezike"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:290
msgid "Leave empty to show every language you publish."
msgstr "Ostavite prazno za prikaz svih jezika koje objavljujete."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:297
msgid "Name each language in its own language"
msgstr "Nazovite svaki jezik na njegovom vlastitom jeziku"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:298
msgid "Deutsch rather than German. Somebody who cannot read the current page cannot read \"German\" either."
msgstr "Deutsch umjesto German. Netko tko ne može čitati trenutnu stranicu ne može čitati ni „German”."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:305
msgid "Show flags"
msgstr "Prikaži zastavice"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:306
msgid "Off by default: a language is not a country, and Arabic and Spanish have no single flag that does not exclude most of their speakers."
msgstr "Isključeno prema zadanim postavkama: jezik nije država, a arapski i španjolski nemaju jednu zastavu koja ne isključuje većinu njihovih govornika."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:313
msgid "Include the language being read"
msgstr "Uključi jezik koji se čita"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:320
msgid "Include the original language"
msgstr "Uključi izvorni jezik"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:327
msgid "Add it to this menu"
msgstr "Dodajte ga u ovaj izbornik"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:328
msgid "Only the menu you name here. Nothing is added to any other menu on the site."
msgstr "Samo izbornik koji ovdje navedete. Ništa se ne dodaje nijednom drugom izborniku na web-mjestu."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:378
msgid "Accent"
msgstr "Naglasak"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:382
msgid "Background"
msgstr "Pozadina"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:386
msgid "Text"
msgstr "Tekst"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:390
msgid "Corner radius"
msgstr "Radijus zaobljenja ruba"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:394
msgid "Spacing"
msgstr "Razmak"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:398
msgid "Text size"
msgstr "Veličina teksta"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:425
msgid "Do not add it to a menu"
msgstr "Nemojte ga dodati u izbornik"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:480
msgid "Edit any translation here. An edited translation is kept exactly as you wrote it and is never overwritten when the page is translated again."
msgstr "Ovdje uredite bilo koji prijevod. Uređeni prijevod zadržava se točno onako kako ste ga napisali i nikada se ne prepisuje kada se stranica ponovno prevodi."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:501
msgid "Every language"
msgstr "Svaki jezik"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:508
msgid "Search translations"
msgstr "Pretraži prijevode"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:509
msgid "Filter"
msgstr "Filtriraj"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:514
msgid "Content"
msgstr "Sadržaj"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:515
msgid "Language"
msgstr "Jezik"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:516
msgid "Translation"
msgstr "Prijevod"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:517
msgid "Status"
msgstr "Status"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:518
#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:537
msgid "Save"
msgstr "Spremi"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:523
msgid "Nothing translated yet. Publish a language and translation starts in the background."
msgstr "Ništa još nije prevedeno. Objavite jezik i prijevod će započeti u pozadini."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:556
msgid "These addresses are live. Open any of them to check it, and submit the sitemap index to Google Search Console."
msgstr "Ove su adrese aktivne. Otvorite bilo koju od njih kako biste je provjerili i pošaljite indeks sitemapa u Google Search Console."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:577
msgid "You are not allowed to edit translations on this site."
msgstr "Nije vam dopušteno uređivanje prijevoda na ovoj stranici."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:605
msgid "Edited by you — kept"
msgstr "Uredili ste vi — sačuvano"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:607
msgid "Source changed — will be redone"
msgstr "Izvor je promijenjen — bit će ponovljeno"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:609
msgid "Up to date"
msgstr "Ažurno"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:621
#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:622
msgid "Zinn®"
msgstr "Zinn®"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:719
msgid "Who pays"
msgstr "Tko plaća"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:751
msgid "Comma separated, for example: fr, de, ar"
msgstr "Odvojeno zarezom, na primjer: fr, de, ar"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:755
msgid "Switcher style"
msgstr "Stil preklopnika"

#. translators: %s: the Zinn Digital trade mark, which is not translated.
#: includes/class-zinn-translate-promo.php:241
#: includes/class-zinn-translate-promo.php:299
#, php-format
msgid "%s — guides and services"
msgstr "%s — vodiči i usluge"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-promo.php:256
msgid "User guides"
msgstr "Korisnički vodiči"

#. translators: %s: this plugin's name, e.g. "Zinn® Cache".
#: includes/class-zinn-translate-promo.php:306
#, php-format
msgid "Read the %s user guide"
msgstr "Pročitajte korisnički priručnik za %s"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-promo.php:314
msgid "Hide this"
msgstr "Sakrij ovo"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-promo.php:374
msgid "Zinn® hosting for WordPress"
msgstr "Zinn® hosting za WordPress"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-promo.php:375
msgid "LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site."
msgstr "LiteSpeed, dnevne sigurnosne kopije, besplatna migracija i upravljačka ploča prilagođena osobama koje vode više web-mjesta."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-promo.php:381
msgid "The Zinn® marketplace"
msgstr "Zinn® tržnica"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-promo.php:382
msgid "Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy."
msgstr "Kupujte i prodajite postojeće stranice, domene i postavljanja poveznica, uz sigurno čuvanje novca dok obje strane ne budu zadovoljne."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-promo.php:429
msgid "Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living"
msgstr "Zinn Hub® — zaposlite profesionalce koji se time bave"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-promo.php:430
msgid "Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid."
msgstr "Naše globalno tržište neovisnih stručnjaka: pregledajte više od 10.000 gotovih usluga pisaca, dizajnera, programera i SEO stručnjaka ili objavite projekt i dopustite im da daju ponude."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-prompt.php:211
msgid "The API key was rejected. Check that it is still valid and has translation access, then save it again."
msgstr "API ključ je odbijen. Provjerite je li još uvijek valjan i ima li pristup prevođenju, a zatim ga ponovno spremite."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-prompt.php:218
msgid "The provider refused on billing or quota. Nothing was translated. Check the balance and limits on your account with them."
msgstr "Pružatelj usluge je odbio zbog naplate ili kvote. Ništa nije prevedeno. Provjerite stanje i ograničenja na svom računu kod njih."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-prompt.php:225
msgid "The translation provider is having a problem at their end. Nothing was translated or charged, and it will try again on the next pass."
msgstr "Davatelj usluge prevođenja ima problema na svojoj strani. Ništa nije prevedeno ni naplaćeno, a sustav će pokušati ponovno u sljedećem prolazu."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-prompt.php:231
msgid "The translation request failed and we could not tell why. Nothing was saved."
msgstr "Zahtjev za prijevod nije uspio i nismo mogli utvrditi zašto. Ništa nije spremljeno."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-sitemap.php:130
msgid "Sitemap index"
msgstr "Indeks web-lokacije"

#. translators: %s: a language name, for example "French".
#: includes/class-zinn-translate-sitemap.php:134
#, php-format
msgid "%s sitemap"
msgstr "%s sitemap"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-sitemap.php:138
msgid "LLM content map"
msgstr "Karta sadržaja LLM-a"

#. translators: %s: a language name, for example "French".
#: includes/class-zinn-translate-sitemap.php:141
#, php-format
msgid "%s LLM content map"
msgstr "%s karta sadržaja LLM-a"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-status.php:96
msgid "Languages published"
msgstr "Objavljeni jezici"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-status.php:100
msgid "Site language"
msgstr "Jezik web-mjesta"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-status.php:106
msgid "SEO plugin"
msgstr "SEO dodatak"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-status.php:134
msgid "No translation provider is set up yet."
msgstr "Još nije postavljen nijedan pružatelj usluge prevođenja."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-status.php:135
msgid "Paste an API key from your chosen provider, or connect the site to a Zinn Digital® account, and translation starts on the next pass."
msgstr "Zalijepite API ključ od odabranog davatelja usluga ili povežite web-mjesto s računom za Zinn Digital® i prijevod počinje u sljedećem prolazu."

#. translators: %s: a translation provider's name, for example "DeepL".
#: includes/class-zinn-translate-status.php:144
#, php-format
msgid "Translating with your own %s key."
msgstr "Prevođenje s vašim vlastitim %s ključem."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-status.php:147
msgid "This site is not connected to a Zinn Digital® account, which is fine — your provider bills you directly."
msgstr "Ova stranica nije povezana sa Zinn Digital® računom, što je u redu — vaš vam pružatelj usluga naplaćuje izravno."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-status.php:156
msgid "Not connected to Zinn Digital® yet."
msgstr "Još niste povezani s platformom Zinn Digital®."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-status.php:157
msgid "Add this site's ID and token from your Zinn Digital® dashboard, or switch to your own provider key to run without an account."
msgstr "Dodajte ID i token ove web-lokacije sa svoje nadzorne ploče za Zinn Digital® ili pređite na vlastiti ključ davatelja usluga za rad bez računa."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-status.php:164
msgid "Connected to Zinn Digital®."
msgstr "Povezano s platformom Zinn Digital®."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-status.php:179
msgid "The translation provider is having a problem."
msgstr "Pružatelj usluge prevođenja ima problema."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-status.php:181
msgid "Translation is paused — your provider needs attention."
msgstr "Prijevod je pauziran — vaš pružatelj usluga zahtijeva pažnju."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-status.php:183
msgid "Translation has not been set up yet."
msgstr "Prijevod još nije postavljen."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-status.php:188
msgid "Something went wrong at our end."
msgstr "Došlo je do pogreške s naše strane."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-status.php:200
msgid "Check their status page"
msgstr "Provjerite njihovu stranicu sa statusom"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-status.php:201
msgid "Fix this on your account"
msgstr "Ispravite ovo na svom računu"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-switcher-widget.php:30
msgid "Zinn® language switcher"
msgstr "Jezični izbornik za Zinn®"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-switcher-widget.php:31
#: includes/class-zinn-translate-switcher.php:138
msgid "Let visitors read this page in another language."
msgstr "Omogućite posjetiteljima čitanje ove stranice na drugom jeziku."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-switcher-widget.php:79
msgid "Title"
msgstr "Naslov"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-switcher-widget.php:85
msgid "Use the plugin setting"
msgstr "Upotrijebi postavku dodatka"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-switcher.php:45
msgid "Dropdown"
msgstr "Padajući izbornik"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-switcher.php:46
msgid "Inline list"
msgstr "Ugrađeni popis"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-switcher.php:47
msgid "Pills"
msgstr "Kapsule"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-switcher.php:48
msgid "Minimal text"
msgstr "Minimalni tekst"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-switcher.php:49
msgid "Flags and names"
msgstr "Oznake i nazivi"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-switcher.php:50
msgid "Stacked list"
msgstr "Složeni popis"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-switcher.php:285
msgid "Choose a language"
msgstr "Odaberite jezik"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-updater.php:233
msgid "See the Zinn Digital® release notes."
msgstr "Pogledajte bilješke o izdanju Zinn Digital®."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-updater.php:288
msgid "The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed."
msgstr "Preuzeto ažuriranje nije prošlo provjeru integriteta i nije instalirano."

#: includes/providers/class-zinn-translate-provider-deepl.php:157
msgid "No DeepL API key is saved, so there is nothing to translate with."
msgstr "Nije spremljen nijedan DeepL API ključ, tako da nema ničega za prevođenje."

#. translators: %s: a language name, for example "Swahili".
#: includes/providers/class-zinn-translate-provider-deepl.php:165
#, php-format
msgid "DeepL does not translate into %s. Choose Google Gemini or OpenAI for this language, or connect the site to Zinn Digital®."
msgstr "DeepL ne prevodi na %s. Odaberite Google Gemini ili OpenAI za ovaj jezik ili povežite web-mjesto sa Zinn Digital®-om."

#: includes/providers/class-zinn-translate-provider-deepl.php:207
msgid "DeepL could not be reached. Nothing was translated and nothing was charged; it will try again on the next pass."
msgstr "Nije moguće uspostaviti vezu s uslugom DeepL. Ništa nije prevedeno niti naplaćeno; sustav će ponovno pokušati u sljedećem prolazu."

#: includes/providers/class-zinn-translate-provider-deepl.php:219
msgid "Your DeepL character quota is used up for this period. Translation resumes when it resets, or when you raise the limit on your DeepL account."
msgstr "Vaša kvota znakova za DeepL iskorištena je za ovo razdoblje. Prevođenje se nastavlja kada se ona obnovi ili kada povećate ograničenje na svom DeepL računu."

#: includes/providers/class-zinn-translate-provider-deepl.php:229
msgid "DeepL answered with something we could not read. Nothing was saved."
msgstr "DeepL je odgovorio s nečim što nismo mogli pročitati. Ništa nije spremljeno."

#: includes/providers/class-zinn-translate-provider-gemini.php:107
msgid "No Google Gemini API key is saved, so there is nothing to translate with."
msgstr "Nije spremljen nijedan Google Gemini API ključ, tako da nema ničega s čime bi se moglo prevoditi."

#: includes/providers/class-zinn-translate-provider-gemini.php:155
msgid "Google Gemini could not be reached. Nothing was translated and nothing was charged; it will try again on the next pass."
msgstr "Google Gemini nije dostupan. Ništa nije prevedeno i ništa nije naplaćeno; ponovno će pokušati u sljedećem prolazu."

#: includes/providers/class-zinn-translate-provider-openai.php:103
msgid "No OpenAI API key is saved, so there is nothing to translate with."
msgstr "Nije spremljen nijedan OpenAI API ključ, tako da nema ničega za prevođenje."

#: includes/providers/class-zinn-translate-provider-openai.php:139
msgid "OpenAI could not be reached. Nothing was translated and nothing was charged; it will try again on the next pass."
msgstr "Nije se moglo stupiti u kontakt s platformom OpenAI. Ništa nije prevedeno i ništa nije naplaćeno; sustav će ponovno pokušati u sljedećem prolazu."

#: includes/providers/class-zinn-translate-provider-zinn.php:102
msgid "This site is not connected to Zinn Digital®, so there is nothing to collect. Add the Site ID and token, or switch to your own provider key."
msgstr "Ova stranica nije povezana sa Zinn Digital®, tako da nema ništa za prikupiti. Dodajte ID stranice i token ili pređite na vlastiti ključ pružatelja usluga."

#: includes/providers/class-zinn-translate-provider-zinn.php:135
msgid "This site is not connected to Zinn Digital®."
msgstr "Ova stranica nije povezana sa Zinn Digital®."

#: includes/providers/class-zinn-translate-provider-zinn.php:153
msgid "Zinn Digital® could not be reached. Nothing was sent; it will try again on the next pass."
msgstr "Zinn Digital® nije moguće kontaktirati. Ništa nije poslano; pokušat će ponovno u sljedećem ciklusu."

#: includes/providers/class-zinn-translate-provider-zinn.php:169
msgid "Translation is paused on this site. Check the account is up to date on your Zinn Digital® dashboard."
msgstr "Prijevod je pauziran na ovoj web-lokaciji. Provjerite je li račun ažuriran na vašoj nadzornoj ploči za Zinn Digital®."

#: includes/providers/class-zinn-translate-provider-zinn.php:176
msgid "Zinn Digital® rejected this site's token. Copy it again from the site's Translation tab on your dashboard."
msgstr "Zinn Digital® je odbio token ove stranice. Kopirajte ga ponovno s kartice za prijevođenje na nadzornoj ploči stranice."

#: includes/providers/class-zinn-translate-provider-zinn.php:207
msgid "Zinn Digital® could not be reached. Your site keeps serving the translations it already has."
msgstr "Zinn Digital® nije bio dostupan. Vaša stranica nastavlja posluživati već postojeće prijevode."

#: includes/providers/class-zinn-translate-provider-zinn.php:219
msgid "Zinn Digital® answered with something we could not read. Your site keeps serving the translations it already has."
msgstr "Zinn Digital® je odgovorio nečim što nismo mogli pročitati. Vaša stranica nastavlja isživati ​​već postojeće prijevode."
